---
const rows = [
  { dim: "Revenue model",       old: "Time & materials · per developer hour", oldNote: "Capped at headcount", new: "Usage-based · per workflow / conversation / agent run", newNote: "Scales with customer outcome" },
  { dim: "Gross margin",        old: "25–30%", oldNote: "Labor cost passes through", new: "70–80%", newNote: "Platform amortizes across engagements" },
  { dim: "Revenue mix",         old: "Project-bid, one-shot", oldNote: "Re-sells every quarter", new: "ARR-like · usage with annual commits", newNote: "NRR &gt; 100% with successful customers" },
  { dim: "Cost to deliver one engagement", old: "~15 person-engagement", oldNote: "Re-builds plumbing each time", new: "~3 person-engagement + platform", newNote: "Marginal cost drops on each engagement" },
  { dim: "Sales cycle",          old: "RFP → SOW → kickoff · 8–16 weeks", oldNote: "Deck-driven", new: "Studio call → signable SOW · ~60 min", newNote: "Live demo on customer's data" },
  { dim: "Customer concentration risk", old: "High — few big T&M contracts", oldNote: "One churn = double-digit hit", new: "Distributed — per-app usage", newNote: "Hundreds of usage signals per customer" },
  { dim: "Comparable revenue multiple",  old: "1.0–2.0× revenue", oldNote: "IT services comparable", new: "5.0–10.0× revenue", newNote: "Platform / vertical-SaaS comparable" },
];
---

<section class="econ" id="economics">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="s-head">
      <span class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span>Section 06 · Economic transformation</span>
      <h2>Same engineer, same customer.<br/><em>Different unit economics</em>.</h2>
      <p class="lede">
        The acquisition doesn't grow the topline by adding salespeople. It changes <b>what every dollar of services revenue is worth</b> — margin, multiple, durability. Below: how seven structural dimensions shift on the day of close.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="table-wrap">
      <header class="th">
        <span class="th-dim">Dimension</span>
        <span class="th-old">Body-shop SI</span>
        <span class="th-new">Platform-leveraged SI</span>
      </header>
      {
        rows.map(({ dim, old, oldNote, new: newV, newNote }) => (
          <div class="tr">
            <span class="td td-dim">{dim}</span>
            <span class="td td-old">
              <span class="td-v" set:html={old} />
              <span class="td-note">{oldNote}</span>
            </span>
            <span class="td td-new">
              <span class="td-v" set:html={newV} />
              <span class="td-note">{newNote}</span>
            </span>
          </div>
        ))
      }
    </div>

    <div class="econ-summary">
      <div class="es-row">
        <span class="es-k">Acquirer's revenue base</span>
        <span class="es-v">$1.0B services revenue at 25% margin = $250M gross profit</span>
      </div>
      <div class="es-arr">→</div>
      <div class="es-row es-row-on">
        <span class="es-k on">Re-platformed revenue base</span>
        <span class="es-v on">$1.0B revenue at <b>75% margin = $750M</b> gross profit · 5–10× revenue multiple on the rest</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="econ-note">
      The math reads aggressively. It's also <b>exactly the transformation McKinsey, Bain, and Capgemini bought into</b> when they invested in OpenAI's Deployment Company — they paid for a seat at the platform table rather than continue billing labor against a model that's becoming a free productized layer.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .econ {
    padding: 120px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-ink-100);
    background: var(--color-ink-50);
  }
  .s-head { max-width: 880px; margin-bottom: 48px; }
  .s-head .eyebrow { display: block; margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .s-head h2 {
    font-size: clamp(28px, 3.4vw, 40px);
    letter-spacing: -0.022em;
    line-height: 1.15;
    color: var(--color-ink-950);
  }
  .s-head h2 em {
    font-style: normal;
    color: var(--color-indigo-600);
  }
  .s-head .lede {
    margin-top: 18px;
    font-size: 17px;
    color: var(--color-ink-700);
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 780px;
  }
  .s-head .lede b { color: var(--color-ink-950); font-weight: 600; }

  /* ── Table ────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .table-wrap {
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-ink-200);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .th {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 1fr 1fr;
    background: var(--color-ink-950);
    color: #fff;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10.5px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .th > span {
    padding: 14px 20px;
  }
  .th-old { color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55); border-left: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); }
  .th-new {
    color: #fff;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(79,70,229,0.12), transparent);
    border-left: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    position: relative;
  }
  .th-new::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
    height: 2px;
    background: var(--color-indigo-500);
  }

  .tr {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 1fr 1fr;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-ink-100);
  }
  .tr:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
  .td {
    padding: 18px 20px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
  }
  .td-dim {
    background: var(--color-ink-50);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 14.5px;
    letter-spacing: -0.005em;
    color: var(--color-ink-950);
  }
  .td-old { border-left: 1px solid var(--color-ink-100); }
  .td-new { border-left: 1px solid var(--color-ink-100); background: var(--color-indigo-50); }
  .td-v {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 15px;
    letter-spacing: -0.005em;
    color: var(--color-ink-950);
    line-height: 1.3;
  }
  .td-old .td-v { color: var(--color-ink-700); }
  .td-new .td-v { color: var(--color-indigo-700); }
  .td-note {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--color-ink-500);
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    .th, .tr { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .th-old, .th-new, .td-old, .td-new { border-left: 0; }
    .td-dim { padding-bottom: 6px; }
    .tr { padding: 8px 0; }
    .td { padding: 8px 20px; }
  }

  /* ── Summary row ──────────────────────────────────────── */
  .econ-summary {
    margin-top: 24px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 32px 1fr;
    gap: 0;
    align-items: stretch;
  }
  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    .econ-summary { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .es-arr { display: none; }
  }
  .es-row {
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-ink-200);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: 18px 22px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
  }
  .es-row-on {
    background: var(--color-ink-950);
    border-color: transparent;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
  }
  .es-k {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10.5px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-ink-500);
  }
  .es-k.on { color: var(--color-lavender-300); }
  .es-v {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 17px;
    letter-spacing: -0.012em;
    line-height: 1.35;
    color: var(--color-ink-950);
  }
  .es-v.on { color: #fff; }
  .es-v.on b { color: var(--color-indigo-500); font-weight: 600; }
  .es-arr {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 22px;
    color: var(--color-ink-300);
  }

  .econ-note {
    margin-top: 28px;
    padding: 20px 24px;
    background: var(--color-lavender-50);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-lavender-200);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    color: var(--color-ink-700);
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .econ-note b { color: var(--color-ink-950); font-weight: 600; }
</style>
